## Terminal
Close only as:
- **GLOBAL_POSITIVE_SUPPORTED** — multiple prospective rounds satisfy the definition and beat matched continual-optimization baselines;
- **LOCAL_ONLY** — gains exist but unavoidable regressions prevent global certification;
- **OVERCONSERVATIVE** — rule prevents harmful change but accepts too few useful improvements;
- **REFUTED** — no incremental value beyond strong baselines;
- **CANNOT_CHECK** — protected multi-domain evaluation unavailable.

The purpose is to make “globally positive” harder and more meaningful, not easier to claim.

