- How much information should be supplied at each cutoff?
- How do we test scientific discovery when the later historical theory was itself incomplete?
- What constitutes a decisive hidden prediction rather than hindsight overlap?
- How do we separate discovery ability from enormous brute-force search?
- Can the same ORION mechanism transfer across mathematics and natural science?

